10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"等待红方进兵去卒时，黑方再飞象去掉红方的七路兵，这种布局它的好处是让红方的二路车停留在二路线的位置，不让它跑到七路线来威胁黑方的三路马。","text":"等待红方进兵去卒时，黑方再飞象去掉红方的七路兵，这种布局它的好处是让红方的二路车停留在二路线的位置，不让它跑到七路线来威胁黑方的三路马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"红方跳出八路马。","text":"红方跳出八路马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"黑方平包兑车与前著飞象去卒是有关联的布局。","text":"黑方平包兑车与前著飞象去卒是有关联的布局。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"由於黑方的飞象，红方的巡河车威力较小了，所以这一步棋红方要进车兑车。","text":"由於黑方的飞象，红方的巡河车威力较小了，所以这一步棋红方要进车兑车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"兑车之後再跃出七路马盘河。","text":"兑车之後再跃出七路马盘河。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"黑方跳出八路马。","text":"黑方跳出八路马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方平炮射马为布局抢先的要著。","text":"红方平炮射马为布局抢先的要著。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"黑方也跃马盘河。","text":"黑方也跃马盘河。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":"红方平车抓包，黑方有包二平三跟包二平四的下法，我们分别看。","text":"红方平车抓包，黑方有包二平三跟包二平四的下法，我们分别看。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment22","raw_text":"包二平三的好处是马上兑炮。","text":"包二平三的好处是马上兑炮。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment23","raw_text":"红方接受兑子，现在由红方下。","text":"红方接受兑子，现在由红方下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"0:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"红方进马踩马抢得先机。","text":"红方进马踩马抢得先机。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment26","raw_text":"黑方上象保马。","text":"黑方上象保马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"0:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment27","raw_text":"红方再兵三进一，这样红方比较好下。","text":"红方再兵三进一，这样红方比较好下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"0:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22","raw_text":"那麽这步棋红方如果平士角炮打马。","text":"那麽这步棋红方如果平士角炮打马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"1:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23","raw_text":"红方进马踩马当然。","text":"红方进马踩马当然。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"1:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_24","raw_text":"黑方退象保马也当然。","text":"黑方退象保马也当然。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"1:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25","raw_text":"红方进马去马抢中卒。","text":"红方进马去马抢中卒。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"1:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_29","raw_text":"抢到中卒之後，红方进三路兵，局面到此红方比较好下。","text":"抢到中卒之後，红方进三路兵，局面到此红方比较好下。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"1:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_30","raw_text":"黑方虽然有平车抓炮的先手利。","text":"黑方虽然有平车抓炮的先手利。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"1:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_31","raw_text":"但红方也顺势架当头炮，红方随时可以进跨河车抓马，局面到此红方略优。||||这盘棋当红方第5手兵七进一邀兑时，黑方居然可以不进卒去兵。而下飞象防守。故意让红方进兵去卒。黑方再飞象到河边，站在红方的立场一定要了解，黑方之所以这样下红方的巡河车威力就大减了。所以当红方跳出正马，黑方平包兑车时。由於红方的巡河车威力降低了，所以这一步棋要进车兑车，这一盘布局的重点就在这里。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","text":"但红方也顺势架当头炮，红方随时可以进跨河车抓马，局面到此红方略优。\n\n这盘棋当红方第5手兵七进一邀兑时，黑方居然可以不进卒去兵。而下飞象防守。故意让红方进兵去卒。黑方再飞象到河边，站在红方的立场一定要了解，黑方之所以这样下红方的巡河车威力就大减了。所以当红方跳出正马，黑方平包兑车时。由於红方的巡河车威力降低了，所以这一步棋要进车兑车，这一盘布局的重点就在这里。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"1:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["四、当头炮巡河车进马封车攻平炮兑车局"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第4节 巡河车攻击篇 第二章"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":29,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":2,"structured_branches":1,"line_statuses":{"legal":2},"source_move_records":37,"legal_move_records":37,"annotations":23,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":23}},"membership